# covers: 3 Exponentiation
# covers: 3 Integer overflow
# kind: edge
# expect: trap overflowed `Int64`

powerOverflow is module
powerOverflow purpose "Trap: power overflow"
powerOverflow path powerOverflow
powerOverflow imports standard.math
powerOverflow exports main

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect none
main uses none
main memoryHeap false
main async false
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main let one Int64 1 immutable
main let ten Int64 10 immutable
main let twenty Int64 20 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main at begin do compute
main at begin return ok okCode

compute is call
compute in main
compute invokes math.powerInt64
compute argument base Int64 ten copy
compute argument exponent Int64 twenty copy
compute result result Int64
compute ownedBy none
compute cleanedBy none
compute borrows none
compute catch none
compute suppresses none
